```diff
--- a/invoice.mjs
+++ b/invoice.mjs
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 export function total(q, p, d) {
-  return q + p * (1 - d);
+  return q * p * (1 - d);
 }
```

The bug: the original code computed `q + p * (1 - d)` (quantity plus discounted price) instead of the contractually correct `q * p * (1 - d)` (quantity times discounted unit price).

The bug is clear: the current implementation returns `q + p * (1 - d)` (adding quantity to discounted price) instead of `q * p * (1 - d)` (quantity times discounted unit price), as the contract specifies.

